# P6 wildcard certificate spike template.
#
# This file is intentionally named .example so Caddy does not import it.
# To run the spike on Heimdall, copy it to:
#   sites/manual/wildcard-spike.caddy
# Then validate and reload Caddy through the control-plane container.
#
# Requirements:
# - CADDY_DNS_PROVIDER=namecheap
# - NAMECHEAP_API_KEY and NAMECHEAP_API_USER present in the Caddy container
# - The caddy image was built with github.com/caddy-dns/namecheap
# - staging.lucchesi.io DNS delegates to the DNS provider used by the snippet

*.staging.lucchesi.io, staging.lucchesi.io {
  import namecheap_tls
  respond "wildcard ok" 200
}
